ssociation-status-reason-duplicate\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDuplicate\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe relationship status changed because the association record was identified as a duplicate.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style\u003d\"white-space:nowrap\"\u003epatient-deceased\u003ca name\u003d\"deviceassociation-status-reason-patient-deceased\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003ePatient Deceased\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe relationship status changed because the patient associated with the device is deceased.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style\u003d\"white-space:nowrap\"\u003edevice-retired\u003ca name\u003d\"deviceassociation-status-reason-device-retired\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDevice Retired\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe relationship status changed because the device was retired from service.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style\u003d\"white-space:nowrap\"\u003eassociation-ended\u003ca name\u003d\"deviceassociation-status-reason-association-ended\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eAssociation Ended\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe relationship status changed because the association ended.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style\u003d\"white-space:nowrap\"\u003eunknown\u003ca name\u003d\"deviceassociation-status-reason-unknown\"\u003e \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUnknown\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThe reason for the relationship status is not known.\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e"
